    "body": "Happening for me, fish 3.0.2 and starship 0.25.1. If the previous command takes long enough to trigger duration display in the prompt, that status isn't reset when hitting enter.\r\n\r\nAlso, this may be worth a separate issue, but a separator/icon would be nice, perhaps the 🕒 emoji?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"507\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-11-02 at 13 55 44\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/686573/68076925-79a0e080-fd78-11e9-9be4-df1883371b12.png\">\r\n",
